# cookbook kept, Prog 1. Room: 508, finished: completed again (completeQuest on a completed quest), the Memoirs, the
# vars cleared, the cookbook taken, Wait = 1800198000. Jonette: no section (Wait = the tally), 365.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Jonette/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/505 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/506 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/507 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/508 Sacrarium/qm_tavnazian_cookbook/onTrigger PhomiunaAqueducts/qm_tavnazian_cookbook/onTrigger
